# CODEOWNERS for a repository that holds a Lodge inventory (what Lodge reads: inventory/<kind>/...).
# Copy it to .github/CODEOWNERS (or CODEOWNERS / docs/CODEOWNERS) in *that* repo, replace the
# @team handles, and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection of the
# branch Lodge tracks (Git__GitHub__Branch).
#
# Why this matters: Lodge runs what the inventory says. Merging to the tracked branch is how
# an action is created, how a playbook (a Dockerfile, a script, an Ansible role, a Terraform
# module) changes, and how a `requires:` group or a `policy:` is relaxed. An `AUTO` action runs
# with no human in front of it, so whoever may edit a playbook folder an AUTO action builds
# may run code unattended on the docker host. The last matching pattern wins, so keep the most
# sensitive paths last.

# Everyone who may propose changes to the desired state. Their review is the "should this
# exist?" gate; Lodge's own confirm step is the "run it now" gate.
/inventory/                                       @your-org/platform

# Instance data: the desired state itself. Owners of the thing it describes.
/inventory/*/instances/                           @your-org/platform @your-org/service-owners

# What can be done and by whom: capabilities, per-instance overrides, the kind's defaults.
# Changing a `policy:` to AUTO, dropping `requires:`, or widening `security:` happens here.
/inventory/*/capabilities/                        @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/inventory/*/instances/*/overrides.yaml           @your-org/platform @your-org/security
/inventory/*/kind.yaml                            @your-org/platform @your-org/security

# What runs: playbook folders (Dockerfiles, scripts, roles, modules). Code review, not data review.
/inventory/*/playbooks/                           @your-org/platform @your-org/security

# Facts declared as already done: they stop Lodge from running the action, so a wrong one hides work.
/inventory/*/instances/*/past_history.yaml        @your-org/platform

# The per-kind JSON Schema gates which revisions Lodge will reconcile at all.
/inventory/*/instance.schema.json                 @your-org/platform

# CI and ownership itself: an unreviewed edit here undoes everything above.
/.github/                                         @your-org/security
/CODEOWNERS                                       @your-org/security
